for lang in ['zh','en']:
 p=root/lang/'zyx/architecture/native-single-file-storage-plan.mdx'
 text='''\n冷 pending-owner 字段／存活位准备见 `20261023-core-cost-cold-pending-liveness/`。夹具现在可以构造实际只有 63 个 Node 或 Edge 的源；第 64 个实体在实际 Entity Map 中不存在，源 live／列／冷目录与这 63 个实体一致，不靠假清位模拟新 owner。显式准备选项可计划兼容热值／NULL 或不兼容值的整列降级，并在同一私有页集中合并 pending owner 的冷根、存活位和列；原先不声明 pending 协调的默认调用仍拒绝，clear_live 仍不能通过列合并入口放行。准备器验证实际源实体缺席、唯一 owner、组／namespace、无竞争 ROW／legacy selector，目标冷根中的降级值逐个匹配不可变列计划；结构性展开仍受 64-owner／64 列计划／4096 实际迁移 membership／1 MiB 边界。\n\n先准备已声明 pending 集的存活位与兼容热计划，再将新冷根／整列降级合入同一组的原 COW 图像；现有冷根仍按原 pin／原块代次与原全局热集合认证。可同时移除旧 owner 并增加新 owner，但删除只有在全部实际热成员／冷根已移除后才清位；目标仍有新 owner 时不得误删组／membership／GroupDirectory。59 项定向检查涵盖 Node 热 NULL、无属性 Edge、新冷根、全部原列成员迁移、删除原 63 个 owner 同时新增第 64 个、重复／存活／跨组／错 namespace 拒绝和账户退款。原 59 项报告中混合 birth/deletion 被旧合并 liveness guard 拒绝的失败保留；新增独立显式 pending-merge 选项后通过，默认合并依然拒绝。相关模块结果与源码身份见归档。\n\n这些仍是零写入私有字段计划，不能替代 NativeHybridTopologyPublication 的既有封闭实体创建凭证、逻辑 ID lease、实际 Entity／邻接／标签／派生状态以及同批大值安装。负向检查证明只传私有候选与 pending 字段，原 Native 协调器仍拒绝缺少 sealed new-owner graph publication 的请求。与实际创建协调器的衔接、跨组协调、冷模式物理安装、真实公开转换／完整生命周期、完整空间准入和最终 P7 仍待完成；生产冷转换入口不放开，进度 90%，无全量单测／性能矩阵／提交／推送。\n''' if lang=='zh' else '''\nCold pending-owner field/liveness preparation is recorded in `20261023-core-cost-cold-pending-liveness/`. Fixtures can now create an actual63-Node or63-Edge source: entity64 is absent from the actual Entity Map, and source live/columns/cold directories match those63 entities. An explicit preparation option plans compatible hot/NULL insertion or incompatible whole-column demotion and merges pending cold roots/liveness/columns in the same private images. Defaults without declared pending coordination still refuse; column merging never enables clear_live. Authenticate actual source absence, unique owners, group/namespace, competing ROW/legacy-selector absence and canonical final demoted values against immutable plans. Structural expansion retains64owner/64column-plan/4096actual emitted-membership/1MiB bounds.\n\nPrepare declared pending liveness and compatible hot plans first, then merge new cold roots/whole-column demotion into the same original COW images. Authenticate existing cold roots under original pin/block generation/global hot set. Birth and deletion can share a batch; clear old liveness only after complete actual hot/cold removal, and do not erase group/membership/GroupDirectory if a new owner survives.59 targeted checks cover Node hot NULL, propertyless Edge, new cold roots, all original column members, replacing all63 old owners with new owner64, duplicate/live/cross-group/wrong-namespace refusal and refunds. Preserve the original59-case failure where the old merge liveness guard rejected mixed birth/deletion; a separate explicit pending-merge option now passes while default merging still refuses. Related module receipts and source identity are archived alongside.\n\nThese remain zero-write private field plans. They cannot replace existing sealed NativeHybridTopologyPublication creation authority, logical ID leases, actual Entity/adjacency/labels/derived state or batch-local value installation. A negative test proves that supplying private candidate/pending fields alone still fails the original coordinator's sealed new-owner graph requirement. Actual creation coordination, cross-group coordination, cold physical installation, real public conversion/full lifecycle, whole-space admission and final P7 remain open. Production cold conversion remains closed; progress90%, no full suite/timing matrix/commit/push.\n'''
 s=p.read_text();assert '20261023-core-cost-cold-pending-liveness/' not in s;p.write_text(s+text)
 p=root/lang/'zyx/architecture/optimization.mdx';s=p.read_text();old='逆转换及 owner 删除准备与证据' if lang=='zh' else 'inverse and owner-deletion preparation/evidence';new='逆转换、owner 删除及 pending 字段／存活位准备与证据' if lang=='zh' else 'inverse, owner-deletion and pending field/liveness preparation/evidence';assert old in s;s=s.replace(old,new);p.write_text(s)
 p=root/lang/'zyx/architecture/native-capability-acceptance-matrix.mdx';s=p.read_text();s+= ('\n冷 pending-owner 字段／存活位：`20261023-core-cost-cold-pending-liveness/` 验证实际 63-owner 源上的新冷根、热 NULL、整列降级和 birth/deletion 私有页合并；未接通实际 sealed 实体创建／物理发布，不算公开转换或 P7，进度 90%。\n' if lang=='zh' else '\nCold pending-owner fields/liveness: `20261023-core-cost-cold-pending-liveness/` verifies new cold roots, hot NULL, whole-column demotion and birth/deletion private images on actual63-owner sources. Actual sealed Entity creation/physical publication remains unconnected; no public-conversion/P7 acceptance, progress90%.\n');p.write_text(s)
